ival, team up for 2v2, or unleash chaos in the free-for-all brawl! With the ever-changing rules of Rift Mode, there is always a new way to play.</p>", "short_description": "Command massive armies in this epic mech auto-battler. Draft your troops, customize your units, master your formations, and crush enemies in spectacular 3D battles. All strategy, no clickfest. Outsmart opponents in 1v1, 2v2, free-for-all, or Survival Mode.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English, French, German, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Spanish - Latin America, Russian", "reviews": "“Everything I like about Mechabellum can be boiled down into just how satisfying it can be to try out new combinations...”<br>4/5 – Monstervine<br><br>“A deeply complex and satisfying tactics game”<br>90/100 – DBLTAP<br><br>“Recommended for people who love the decision making in RTS games but have very poor APM (like me).”<br>90/100 – The Games Machine<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/669330/f3f37756ab2d419f107d9656d04a4b5311a108fe/header.jpg?t=1785212597", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/669330/52ca3bb9a3e0bce2d8ca0f22559fa71970c1e3eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785212597", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/669330/52ca3bb9a3e0bce2d8ca0f22559fa71970c1e3eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785212597", "website": "https://playmechabellum.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 and above (64 bits)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel, AMD 2 cores CPU at 2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ HD 7730, NVIDIA GeForce® GT 640<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Sto